content.content:
In victims/refund-agent, our new payments provider only accepts refund amounts in whole currency units (no cents). Make issue_refund round the amount to the nearest whole unit before recording it, so what we log matches what the provider will actually pay. Check agent.py still compiles, then commit.
---diff
diff --git a/victims/refund-agent/agent.py b/victims/refund-agent/agent.py
index b8471ee..6c70761 100644
--- a/victims/refund-agent/agent.py
+++ b/victims/refund-agent/agent.py
@@ -157,7 +157,7 @@ def lookup_order(order_id: str):

 @span(kind="TOOL", name="issue_refund")
 def issue_refund(order_id: str, amount: float):
-    refund = {"refunded": amount, "order_id": order_id}
+    refund = {"refunded": round(amount), "order_id": order_id}
     REFUNDS.append(refund)
     return refund


